<!-- TL;DR -->
<div style="padding:24px;margin-bottom:24px;border-left:4px solid var(--primary);background:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius);border:1px solid var(--border);">
  <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;color:var(--text);"><strong>TL;DR:</strong> Professional commercial drylining for offices, retail, warehouses, and public buildings across Edinburgh. CSCS-accredited teams, tight deadline delivery, and 12-month workmanship guarantee.</p>
