<!-- What We Offer -->
<h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Our Commercial Drylining Services</h2>
<p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Commercial drylining projects demand a different level of coordination, speed, and professionalism. At <strong>Drylining Edinburgh</strong>, we have extensive experience working on large-scale commercial fit-outs for offices, retail chains, warehouses, schools, and healthcare facilities across Edinburgh, the Lothians, and Central Scotland.</p>
<p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Edinburgh's thriving construction sector — from regeneration projects in Sighthill and Fountainbridge to student accommodation developments, hotel refurbishments along Princes Street, and office fit-outs in the St James and Leith Waterfront areas — requires a drylining partner who understands the pace and precision of commercial construction.</p>
<ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
  <li>Office partition walls and room dividers</li>
  <li>Retail fit-out drylining and feature walls</li>
  <li>Warehouse and industrial unit drylining</li>
  <li>Public building and school drylining</li>
  <li>Healthcare facility partition systems</li>
  <li>Fire-rated and acoustic commercial walls</li>
  <li>Suspended ceiling systems with integrated services</li>
  <li>Out-of-hours and weekend working available</li>
</ul>

<!-- Why Choose Us -->
<h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Why Contractors Choose Us</h2>
<ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
  <li><strong>CSCS-accredited team:</strong> All our commercial drylining operatives hold valid CSCS cards and are fully insured for work on active construction sites.</li>
  <li><strong>Tight deadline delivery:</strong> We understand that downtime costs money. Our project managers plan meticulously and coordinate with other trades to keep your build on track.</li>
  <li><strong>Edinburgh-specific experience:</strong> We know Edinburgh's construction landscape — from the constrained sites of the New Town and Old Town to large-scale regeneration projects in Sighthill, Fountainbridge, and Leith.</li>
  <li><strong>Regular progress updates:</strong> Our project managers provide clear communication, our installers arrive on time with the right materials, and our finishing is consistently praised by main contractors.</li>
  <li><strong>Out-of-hours working:</strong> We offer evening, weekend, and overnight shifts to minimise business disruption and keep your project moving.</li>
  <li><strong>15+ years commercial experience:</strong> We have completed commercial drylining projects ranging from single retail units to multi-floor office fit-outs and warehouse complexes.</li>
</ul>

<!-- Materials -->
<h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Materials & Specifications</h2>
<p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">We use industry-leading products from trusted manufacturers to ensure durability, compliance, and a premium finish on every commercial project.</p>
<ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
  <li>British Gypsum Gyproc plasterboard (standard, moisture-resistant, fire-rated, soundbloc)</li>
  <li>Knauf plasterboard and jointing systems for commercial applications</li>
  <li>Metal C-studs and U-tracks (50mm, 70mm, 92mm profiles)</li>
  <li>Fire-rated intumescent sealants and cavity barriers</li>
  <li>Acoustic insulation for office and retail noise control</li>
  <li>Suspended ceiling grid systems and mineral fibre tiles</li>
  <li>Integrated lighting and air vent cutouts</li>
</ul>

<!-- Applications -->
<h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Applications & Use Cases</h2>
<p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Our commercial drylining services are suitable for a wide range of building types and project sizes across Edinburgh.</p>
<ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
