  <li>Retail chain roll-outs and shop fitting (Princes Street, St James Quarter, Orchard Brae)</li>
  <li>Warehouse and industrial unit partitioning (Fountainbridge, Ingliston, Sighthill)</li>
  <li>School and education building upgrades (City of Edinburgh Council projects)</li>
  <li>Healthcare and care home interior works</li>
  <li>Public building refurbishments</li>
  <li>Call centre and co-working space fit-outs</li>
  <li>Student accommodation drylining (Edinburgh has 20,000+ student bedrooms)</li>
</ul>

<!-- How It Works -->
